Dweller is a web browser for people and AI agents, written in [Aye](https://gith ub.com/aye-lang/aye); its sources are in `browser/` (see `browser/README.md` and  `docs/browser.md`), and this repository builds it with the Aye compiler pinned  in `AYE_REV`. Install that compiler with `cargo install --git https://github.com /aye-lang/aye --rev $(cat AYE_REV) --locked aye` (or, with a checkout of Aye, se t `AYE=/path/to/aye/target/release/aye`), install SDL2, FreeType and libcurl (Ha rfBuzz and brotli optional; on Ubuntu 24.04 run `sh scripts/setup-ubuntu.sh`), t hen run the commands below from the repository root.

```
aye check browser
aye test browser
aye build browser                                   # writes ./dweller
AYE=$(command -v aye) cargo test --release --test browser
```

